Terminals unused in grammar

    FLOAT_LITERAL
    UMINUS


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: recipe_declaration

    2 recipe_declaration: RECIPE IDENTIFIER LBRACE step_list RBRACE

    3 step_list: step_list step_declaration
    4          | step_declaration

    5 step_declaration: STEP INTEGER_LITERAL LBRACE action_list RBRACE

    6 if_statement: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE action_list RBRACE

    7 expression: term
    8           | expression ADD_OP term
    9           | expression SUB_OP term

   10 term: factor
   11     | term MUL_OP factor
   12     | term DIV_OP factor

   13 factor: INTEGER_LITERAL
   14       | IDENTIFIER
   15       | STRING_LITERAL
   16       | LPAREN expression RPAREN

   17 condition: logical_condition

   18 logical_condition: relation_condition
   19                  | logical_condition AND_OP relation_condition

   20 relation_condition: expression EQ_OP expression
   21                   | expression NE_OP expression
   22                   | expression GT_OP expression
   23                   | expression LT_OP expression

   24 while_statement: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE action_list RBRACE

   25 repeat_statement: REPEAT INTEGER_LITERAL TIMES LBRACE action_list RBRACE
   26                 | REPEAT IDENTIFIER TIMES LBRACE action_list RBRACE

   27 assignment: SET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   28 action_list: action_list action SEMICOLON
   29            | action SEMICOLON

   30 action: GET IDENTIFIER
   31       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL G_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   32       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL L_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   33       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL P_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   34       | ADD IDENTIFIER TO IDENTIFIER
   35       | COOK IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   36       | RETURN IDENTIFIER
   37       | BOIL IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   38       | DRAIN IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
   39       | MIX IDENTIFIER
   40       | SERVE IDENTIFIER
   41       | assignment
   42       | if_statement
   43       | while_statement
   44       | repeat_statement


